sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as React/Browser
  participant G as Gateway
  participant A as Auth
  participant L as Link
  participant S as Analytics
  UI->>G: POST /api/auth/login
  G->>A: credentials
  A->>A: Argon2 verify + session INSERT
  A-->>UI: user + HttpOnly cookie via Gateway
  UI->>G: POST /api/links + cookie
  G->>A: verify session
  G->>L: trusted proxy request
  L->>A: verify session again
  L->>L: UNIQUE code INSERT in owned DB
  L-->>UI: 201 link via Gateway
  UI->>G: GET /code (legacy /s/code)
  G->>L: public redirect
  L->>L: availability/expiry lookup
  L->>S: POST /internal/visits eventId
  S->>S: unique/idempotent INSERT commit
  S-->>L: recorded true
  L-->>UI: 302 + Location via Gateway
  UI->>G: GET /api/links/id/stats + cookie
  G->>A: verify
  G->>S: stats route before Links route
  S->>A: verify
  S->>L: ownership + summary
  S->>S: owned events count/group
  S-->>UI: stats via Gateway
